## ---
## name: catalog-card
## description: |
##   A bot in one file with a catalog identity: the fenced comment block
##   above the program — YAML inside `## ---` lines — is what `iterion bots
##   list` and the whats-next catalog read; the program below it is read as
##   any other.
## triggers:
##   - catalog-card
##   - card
## capabilities: [board.read]
## ---
## catalog-card.bot — a single-file bot carrying its catalog identity.
##
## Deterministic (compute-only). Run it:
##   iterion run examples/catalog-card.bot

dsl: 2

schema card:
  name: string

compute card:
  output: card
  expr:
    name: "'catalog-card'"

workflow catalog_card:

  entry: card

  card -> done
